// MechScape map: the Scrapyard. Format notes are in README.md (Maps) and
// at the top of tests/maps/test_yard.map. Regions, west to east:
//   Camp (fenced, gates on every side): spawn, weapons bench, metal press,
//     bio-still, storage locker, and the manufactory where you're printed
//     (the spawn is the tile beside it).
//   Drone field, south-west of camp: crashed drones (Salvaging 1).
//   The long wall, with three gaps.
//   Sentry ruins, east of the middle gap: relic sentries among broken walls.
//   Loader yard, north-east: fenced compound of mech hulls (Salvaging 10)
//     guarded by aggressive loader mechs. Gates west and south.
//   Vent fields, far south-east: gas vents in a rocky basin. Siphoning is the
//     most AFK skill, so it sits furthest from spawn, past the sentries.
//     Ventbloom patches (Xenobiology) grow among the vents.
//   Seep flats, north of camp between the long wall and the loader yard:
//     ichor seeps (Siphoning 5), just outside the loaders' reach.
//     Seep moss (Xenobiology 5) grows around them.
//   Inside the loader yard: rustcap clusters (Xenobiology 10), among the
//     loaders.
//   Drone field outskirts: wrecked haulers (Salvaging 5).
//   The Pit, south of the sentry ruins: breacher mechs (aggressive, about
//     level 15) guarding glowroot tangles (Xenobiology 15).
//   Vent fields: coolant leaks (Siphoning 10) at the edges, and ichor
//     wellsprings (Siphoning 15) on the far east rim.

name: Scrapyard

[legend]
.  floor
@  spawn
#  terrain wall
o  terrain rock
=  terrain fence
d  node crashed_drone
h  node derelict_hull
v  node gas_vent
W  station weapons_bench
A  station metal_press
s  npc relic_sentry
L  npc loader_mech
b  node ventbloom_patch
i  node ichor_seep
B  station bio_still
K  station storage_locker
M  station manufactory
H  node wrecked_hauler
m  node seep_moss_patch
r  node rustcap_cluster
g  node glowroot_tangle
c  node coolant_leak
w  node ichor_wellspring
X  npc breacher_mech

